  <h1 class="gd-h1">Proposals & Celebrations on a Heli-Ski Trip</h1>
  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 31 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">Some moments deserve an extraordinary setting, and few are more extraordinary than an Arctic summit with the whole of Iceland below you. Whether you are planning to propose, mark a big anniversary or celebrate a milestone, a heli-ski trip turns the occasion into a shared adventure no one forgets. This guide covers how to plan the moment, keep a surprise, and add the touches that make it special, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
</div></section>
