      <details><summary>Is a heli-ski trip good for an anniversary or milestone?</summary><p>It is superb for marking any milestone, an anniversary, a landmark birthday, a retirement or a long-promised dream. A shared adventure on untracked mountains, followed by a celebration at a four-star fjord lodge, gives the occasion real meaning and a memory that lasts far longer than a gift.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you arrange special touches at the lodge?</summary><p>Often, yes. Tell us the occasion and we can help arrange thoughtful touches with the Sigló Hótel, from a special dinner to marking the moment on your return from the mountain. Just let us know what would make it feel like a celebration and we will do our best to make it happen.</p></details>
